{"repositoryId":622511745,"availability":"available","full":"TopGunBuild/topgun","name":"topgun","description":"Offline-first in-memory data grid with CRDT sync and a Rust server","category":"Developer tools","language":"Rust","stars":36,"forks":2,"created":"2023-04-02T10:40:52Z","updated":"2026-10-17T10:32:45Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://topgun.build","topics":["crdt","data-grid","database","indexeddb","local-first","offline-first","postgresql","react","realtime","rust","sync","typescript","websocket"],"demo":"https://demo.topgun.build/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T11:04:24.689Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T11:04:24.689Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T11:04:24.689Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-13T06:39:55.171Z","stars":36,"forks":2},{"at":"2026-10-17T11:04:24.689Z","stars":36,"forks":2}],"technologies":["React","Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["[](LICENSE) [](.github/workflows/rust.yml) []( []( []( [](","Build real-time apps that work offline. Local writes are instant and survive disconnects; reconnecting clients sync seamlessly with automatic conflict resolution. Self-host today: the server keeps your data in an embedded store, so there is no database to run. Apache-2.0, Rust server, TypeScript client. AI agents talk to your data natively through MCP.","TopGun v2 is a complete rewrite. It's not a port — it's a new architecture built to earn production trust; the status note above says what we do and don't yet claim."],"features":["Local-first: Data lives in memory. Reads and writes never wait for network.","Offline support: Changes persist to IndexedDB and sync when reconnected.","Conflict-free merges: Automatic conflict resolution via LWW-Map and OR-Map, with causality tracked by logical clocks.","Efficient delta sync: Only changed data moves over the wire, via Merkle tree comparison.","Pluggable storage: Data lives in an embedded store inside the server (redb) — no database to run; bring your own client-side adapter."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TopGunBuild/topgun/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5e0825dcfa2bda0cf20722c3cd128427c63caa33ffa8ec78c03d79cb6a9c179a","extractedAt":"2026-10-17T11:04:24.887Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T11:04:24.887Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"[](LICENSE) [](.github/workflows/rust.yml) []( []( []( [](","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TopGunBuild/topgun/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Self-host today: the server keeps your data in an embedded store, so there is no database to run.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TopGunBuild/topgun/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"5e0825dcfa2bda0cf20722c3cd128427c63caa33ffa8ec78c03d79cb6a9c179a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TopGunBuild/topgun/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T11:04:24.888Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-17T10:32:45Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TopGunBuild/topgun/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T11:04:24.889Z","hash":"5e0825dcfa2bda0cf20722c3cd128427c63caa33ffa8ec78c03d79cb6a9c179a","originalBytes":14612,"storedBytes":14612,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T11:04:24.689Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Developer tools","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Automation & workflows","MCP servers & agents","Writing & documents","Self-hosted apps"],"reviewRequired":true},"qualityPriority":false,"demoHealth":{"url":"https://demo.topgun.build/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-17T11:23:24.075Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-17T11:23:24.075Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-17T11:23:24.075Z","target":"https://demo.topgun.build/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-